            "content": [
              {
                "type": "paragraph",
                "content": [
                  {
                    "type": "text",
                    "text": "Khabarnaama, an initiative by the AKU Publications & Literary Society, is a newsletter stringing together the creative work of multiple individuals across the Karachi Campus. Through all the impressive content that is featured, the paper aims to instill a sense of community within readers, whilst inspiring them to reflect on their own experiences. The pieces range from being satirical, informative, reflective & poetic in nature, curating the perfect blend for any sort of reader. It also successfully aids in furthering our society's main aim, which is to cultivate a culture of literary arts amongst the AKU community. This year, our newsletter revolved around the theme \"Nostalgia\". Along with writings, we have a crossword section for anyone seeking to challenge their mind and an exclusive page dedicated to Urdu literature enthusiasts! Physical copies of the paper can be spotted around campus. The digital version is attached below. "
                  },
                  {
                    "type": "hard_break"
                  }
                ]
              },
              {
                "type": "paragraph",
                "content": [
                  {
                    "type": "text",
                    "text": "Give it a read and revel at all the creativity!",
